WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.520
I am going to tell you a story.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.480
It's the scariest tale
that you can imagine.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.520
Are you ready?

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.480
Schengen is going to disappear!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.960
It's just a joke!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.760
Schengen is not going anywhere.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.960
What a weird word.
What does "Schengen" even mean?

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:44.040
It can be compared to a
security blanket covering Europe.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.640
Every contact between two countries
is like a thread connecting them.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.360
Studies have shown that
the more contacts there are

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.680
the more new ones are created.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.640
And the more threads are created

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.560
the thicker is the
security blanket covering Europe.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.680
Thus the warmer and cosier 
it is for us to live here.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.720
Schengen agreement means

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.400
that 26 European
countries have decided

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.520
to knock down the borders
that separate each other.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.720
Thus it is really
easy for us to travel

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.440
whereever we want in Europe.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.960
No border checks save Europeans

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.920
millions of hours of valuable time.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.160
Some travel two hands in their pockets.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:27.160
Some lug arround loads of stuff.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.560
Freedom of movement across borders

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.160
has made trade between European countries

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.080
much faster and easier.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.120
The trucks used to wait
for hours on borders

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.520
but now no time is wasted there!

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.440
If free movement of goods across
borders would stop in Europe

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.360
it would mean a lot of
additional cost to our economy.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.640
About 30 000 Estonians,

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.840
(this is more than the people living in
Viljandi and Haapsalu together)

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.760
travel between their home and 
place of work abroad frequently.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.640
This would be much more

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.280
complicated without Schengen.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:06.120
For citizens, Schengen means saved
time and simple travel

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:09.360
but also increased security.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.400
The countries work together

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.600
to protect the external borders.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.640
For example we are now building
modern infrastructure on our

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.080
eastern border with the support
of other EU countries.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.400
The police forces of Schengen
countries work together in

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.920
close cooperation to
protect their citizens.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.560
They inform each other of threats

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.560
and other "interesting" findings.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:35.720
Our security forces
are acting as one.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.760
The threat has been eliminated!

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.880
Now I am going to
visit a friend in Greece,

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.440
but I am going via Portugal

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
because it is just so simple!
Ciao!

